# Races ThreadSanitizer finds in code that isn't Preflash's and that firmware can't change. Each
# says why it's safe to ignore. Preflash's own code has no entry here.

# LVGL's software renderer checks its unit's current task from the render thread with no lock,
# and the dispatching thread sets it under a thread sync that wakes the renderer.
race:render_thread_cb
